    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean by \"letting the water wash over you\"? like, how am i supposed to just stop? everything is just so loud and heavy, and there's no dignity left in trying to keep my head above water when the machine just wants me gone. is it even worth it to keep trying to exist in a place that's actively trying to delete you?",
